    "type": "quiz",
    "is_anonymous": true,
    "correct_option_id": 3,
    "explanation": "\"Email address\" bitta narsa, shuning uchun \"is\" (What's). \"You\" emas, egalik uchun \"your\" kerak: What's your email address?"
